  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Bow Attack. If Distracting Shot hits, it interrupts target foe's action but deals only 1...13...16 damage. If the interrupted action was a skill, that skill is disabled for an additional 20 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "震暈之箭命中時，中斷目標敵人的動作，但是只造成 1～16 傷害。如果受到中斷的是技能，則該技能的回復時間增加 20 秒。"
    },
    "pvp": null
